(40,1,'2026-10-20 00:00:00','2026-10-19 23:00:00','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Turn Christmas lunch into an occasion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A festive lunch can be the highlight of the working week. Bring colleagues together to mark the end of the year, or meet friends for an afternoon that stretches beyond a quick meal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Olea Social&#039;s menu draws inspiration from the food cultures of Turkey, Greece, Spain, Italy and Morocco. Its approach to Mediterranean dining makes it a natural setting for a relaxed celebration with people you enjoy spending time with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dinner plans in the heart of Covent Garden</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you&#039;re planning a Christmas dinner, location matters. Olea Social gives your guests a central place to meet, whether dinner is the main event or part of a bigger evening in London.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start with drinks, take your time over dinner and enjoy the company around the table. For an office Christmas party or a gathering with friends and family, share your preferred date and group size with the team so they can help you plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Find your way to celebrate</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every group has its own idea of a good Christmas meal. Some want a long lunch; others are looking forward to an evening of conversation, Mediterranean flavours and Christmas drinks. Olea Social offers a setting for both.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Christmas in Covent Garden: Gather at Olea Social','Christmas lunches, festive dinners and group gatherings with Mediterranean flavours on Upper St Martin\'s Lane.','publish','open','open','','christmas-in-covent-garden','','','2026-10-20 00:00:00','2026-10-19 23:00:00','',0,'http://localhost:3000/blog/christmas-in-covent-garden',0,'post','',0),
(41,1,'2026-11-10 15:36:27','2026-11-10 15:36:27','','blog-exterior','','inherit','open','closed','','blog-exterior','','','2026-11-10 15:36:27','2026-11-10 15:36:27','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/blog-exterior.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),
(42,1,'2026-11-10 00:00:00','2026-11-10 00:00:00','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Little Space for Your Celebration</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our <strong>private dining rooms</strong> bring a more personal feel to your Christmas gathering. Whether you are planning a dinner with close friends or a Christmas party for your team, having a space for your guests makes the occasion feel that little bit more special.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There is room for the conversations, the laughter and the end-of-year toast. Settle in with your guests and let us look after you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Christmas Around Our Table</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our modern Eastern Mediterranean flavours are at the heart of our festive set menu. This is how we like to celebrate: delicious food, glasses raised and everyone enjoying themselves around the table.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join us for a festive lunch or spend the evening with us. Whatever you have planned, we want your <strong>private dining experience</strong> to feel warm and welcoming from the moment you arrive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Christmas Party for the People You Work With</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After a year of busy days and shared achievements, it is lovely to spend time together away from work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bring your team to Olea Social for a <strong>Christmas party</strong>, say thank you over a festive meal and enjoy the chance to catch up properly. Our private dining rooms offer a setting for bringing colleagues together, whether you are planning a lunchtime gathering or an evening celebration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And if someone has a few words to say before the meal, there is always a reason for one more toast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Friends, Family and Festive Catch-Ups</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some Christmas traditions start with a simple dinner invitation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Perhaps it is your annual gathering with friends, a family meal before everyone heads away for the holidays or a Christmas celebration you have been looking forward to for months.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We would love to welcome you. Choose a date, bring your favourite people and enjoy being together. We will take care of the meal — and the washing-up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Let’s Plan Your Christmas Gathering</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have a <strong>private dining room</strong> in mind for your celebration, speak to our team about the spaces available at Olea Social.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tell us a little about your plans, your preferred date and how many guests will be joining you. We can discuss our private dining rooms, festive menu and any dietary requirements together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We look forward to celebrating with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','A Christmas to Remember in Our Private Dining Rooms','Bring friends, family or colleagues together at Olea Social. Explore our private dining rooms and plan your Christmas party with our festive set menu.','publish','open','open','','christmas-private-dining','','','2026-11-10 00:00:00','2026-11-10 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost:3000/blog/christmas-private-dining',0,'post','',0),
